%N A401834 Maximum size of a subset S of {1, ..., n} such that every integer m has at most two representations m = x*y with x < y and x, y in S.
%C A401834 This is g_3(n) in Erdős Problem 796.
%H A401834 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/796">Erdős Problem 796</a>, Erdős Problems.
%F A401834 a(n-1) <= a(n) <= a(n-1) + 1 for n >= 2.
%F A401834 If p is prime, a(p) = a(p-1) + 1.
%Y A401834 Cf. A400464.
%K A401834 nonn,new
%O A401834 1,2
